26-open/) on Wednesday, which consists of 45 potential questions across hardware, software, operating systems, demographics, and AI. Last year's survey received just over 4,000 responses, while this year's has already accumulated *2,000 in just two days*. The survey will remain open until October 31st 👻, and the results will be published in early November. Thanks in advance to all who participate![Take the Survey](https://form.selfh.st/s/ujckvvpgaz0as3unm7ato3xy?ref=selfh.st) Weekly Highlights A [new suite of open source Adobe alternatives](https://github.com/storytold?ref=selfh.st) stirred up some controversy this week after being called out as rip-offs of existing projects", "characters": 12774, "container": "['article [itemtype*=Article]'", "date": "2026-10-09", "epubs": ["Test multi-sites"], "fetched_at": "2026-10-13T00:52:04+0200", "host": "selfh.st", "image": "https://selfh.st/content/images/size/w1200/2026/10/2026-10-09-featured-image.png", "lang": "fr", "problems": [], "revision": 2, "sha256": "eefbb02a70eb308dc37fd9f6f7e077b60140ca35fdd134cbdbefc1c7bb018de5", "slug": "2026-10-09", "source": "url", "status": "translated", "title": "Self-Host Weekly (9 October 2026)", "title_fr": "Self-Host Weekly (9 octobre 2026)", "url": "https://selfh.st/weekly/2026-10-09/"}
